# Density Compare
# Flerovium (Fl) — real density 14 g/cm³. equal masses: Flerovium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Flerovium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.3mm color: #ff5050 at (-20mm, 4.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 111.7 g — the water cube is the reference
